OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWidespread
OL,6,Fcloud across the region through the
OL,7,Fevening with isolated light showers
OL,8,Faround. Cloud breaking at times but
OL,9,Fhill fog lingering across the Cheviots
OL,10,Fand Pennines. Chilly under cloud
OL,11,Fbreaks but generally frost-free.
OL,12,FMostly light winds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FRemaining mostly cloudy
OL,15,Fwith the odd light shower around and
OL,16,Fsome hill fog, although the odd
OL,17,Fbrighter spell is possible. Gentle
OL,18,Fwinds with near average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
